#: ../../docs/installation.md:1 5ace5c8e2b4e40d8bf3f21763fc879f0
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:4 d3893964c5904c188d7c0df8469c9466
msgid "Pybes3 requires Python 3.9 or higher."
msgstr "Pybes3 需要 Python 3.9 或更高版本。"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:7 7b05db512e8c4d519d53f19844edb157
msgid "Install Pybes3 using pip"
msgstr "使用 pip 安装 Pybes3"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:13 29c92965005348429d6781790547ca38
msgid "Users on lxlogin server"
msgstr "lxlogin 服务器上的用户"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:15 7d2c6cfae2564d09a25206a42903b8e4
msgid ""
"\"lxlogin server\" refers to the login server of IHEP computation "
"clusters. If you are not using the lxlogin server, you can skip this "
"section."
msgstr "「lxlogin server」指 IHEP 计算集群的登录服务器。若你不使用 lxlogin 服务器，可以跳过本节。"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:17 05b40fc12cbe4031b538a27cb80d27b2
msgid ""
"Since there is a quota limitation on the user's home directory (`~/`), "
"you need to create symbolic links for `~/.local` and `~/.cache`, which "
"contain pip packages and caches installed in \"user mode\":"
msgstr ""
"由于用户主目录（`~/`）存在配额限制，需要为 `~/.local` 和 `~/.cache` 创建符号链接，它们存放以「用户模式」安装的 pip"
" 包与缓存："

#: ../../docs/installation.md:35 1a7c37705a4c4f269ec5a0cc4d8c0160
msgid "Using Pybes3 under BOSS environment"
msgstr "在 BOSS 环境中使用 Pybes3"

#: ../../docs/installation.md:37 d712cfd869834e4a9eea600664deb5db
msgid ""
"If you are using Pybes3 under a BOSS environment, you **must** run the "
"following commands after setting up the BOSS environment:"
msgstr "如果要在 BOSS 环境下使用 Pybes3，**必须**在完成 BOSS 环境设置后执行以下命令："

#: ../../docs/installation.md:45 5eca415946904f738b24c7f0d8da53ce
msgid ""
"Do **not** add these commands to your shell configuration file (e.g., "
"`~/.bashrc`), since they will conflict with the default Python "
"environment (without BOSS)."
msgstr "**不要**把这些命令写进 shell 配置文件（如 `~/.bashrc`），否则会与（未加载 BOSS 的）默认 Python 环境冲突。"

